@startuml
title FE-11 Member Creates Eligible Review
actor Member
participant ReviewEligibilityController
participant ReviewController
participant ReviewService
participant WorkshopAttendanceReviewPort
participant RetailFulfilmentReviewPort
database ReviewRepository
Member -> ReviewEligibilityController : request own eligible sources
ReviewEligibilityController -> ReviewService : resolve Member sources
ReviewService -> WorkshopAttendanceReviewPort : check CHECKED_IN attendance
ReviewService -> RetailFulfilmentReviewPort : check PICKED_UP/DELIVERED order lines
ReviewService --> ReviewEligibilityController : safe eligible source list
Member -> ReviewController : submit rating/text + idempotency key
ReviewController -> ReviewService : validate source ownership and target
ReviewService -> ReviewRepository : insert PUBLIC review atomically
ReviewRepository --> ReviewService : review result or duplicate conflict
ReviewController --> Member : public review projection
@enduml
